- creating abstractions (set_red to mean red on, yellow off, green off)
- implementing a time and event driven state machine
- enabling stream-based safe-limited serial communications (protocol design with delimiter, length, crc + parsing)
- connecting with an AI api key (google ai studio)
- prompting to use a parsable format (space separated format)
- handling of the response without blocking main thread

